1
00:00:00,690 --> 00:00:02,500
(Raj:)I'd rather get a prostate exam

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:06,130
(Raj:)from a leper who walks away
with nine fingers.

3
00:00:06,130 --> 00:00:09,870
(Priya:)Oh, would you please stop
feeling sorry for yourself?

4
00:00:09,870 --> 00:00:13,220
(Raj:)I have to feel sorry for myself.
I'm the only one who cares.

5
00:00:13,220 --> 00:00:16,010
(Raj:)Just like I'm the only one
who'll have sex with me.

6
00:00:16,010 --> 00:00:18,930
(Leonard:)Really? In front
of your sister?

7
00:00:18,930 --> 00:00:22,920
(Priya:)We shared a room growing up.
This is not news to me.

8
00:00:22,920 --> 00:00:25,740
(Raj:)Excuse me. I'm going to go
wander the streets alone.

9
00:00:25,740 --> 00:00:27,850
Invisible, unwanted and unloved;

10
00:00:27,860 --> 00:00:31,090
(Raj:)a pathetic shadow
in a city with no heart.

11
00:00:33,930 --> 00:00:36,730
(Raj:)I forgot my windbreaker.
It's chilly.

12
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:43,540
(Amy:)I don't understand. Is this
a way to break in new shoes?

13
00:00:43,540 --> 00:00:45,970
(Penny:)No. Once these puppies
touch the ground

14
00:00:45,970 --> 00:00:47,210
(Penny:)they're mine,
and I'll have to wear them

15
00:00:47,210 --> 00:00:48,780
(Penny:)walking up and down
Hollywood Boulevard

16
00:00:48,780 --> 00:00:50,880
(Penny:)in order to pay them off.

17
00:00:52,910 --> 00:00:55,950
(Penny:)Pretty, pretty, pretty.

18
00:00:55,950 --> 00:00:59,420
Good news: the wildebeest
is in the curry.

19
00:00:59,420 --> 00:01:00,890
(Penny:)The what?

